WEBVTT

NOTE Cloud Guardian, Why Choose Us. 30 seconds, 6 scenes.

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Tuesday. Susan runs accounts payable. An email arrives from a client about an unpaid invoice.

2
00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Their bank has changed. Pay the new account before Friday. It looks completely normal.

3
00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
It is not the client. R N, not M. That domain is six days old.

4
00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Cloud Guardian blocked it in two seconds. It was never delivered. Susan never saw it.

5
00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Eighty four thousand stayed put. No insurance claim. Susan is fine, and the chief executive sleeps.

6
00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Cloud Guardian. Twice the quality. Half the price.
